    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629280/extras/9dc008b30b1ad6eb0a0ceab8f6fcf43c.webp?t=1746870056\" width=600 height=38 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 3rd-person action-roguelite space adventure that seamlessly blends text-based events with procedurally generated dungeons, offering hundreds of hours of replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629280/extras/26496099dc738488a78646c7968463b7.poster.avif?t=1746870056\" width=800 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629280/extras/26496099dc738488a78646c7968463b7.webm?t=1746870056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629280/extras/26496099dc738488a78646c7968463b7.mp4?t=1746870056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aggressive, brutal combat that leaves no room for mercy - permadeath is a constant threat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A plethora of guns, each leveled and uniquely seeded for countless combination possibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated levels ensure that no two playthroughs are alike, with over 4 billion seeded runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destructible environments allow you to carve your way through each space station, creating new flanking opportunities or launching enemies into space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629280/extras/96b30bb5f0e162908f933105b732e5cf.poster.avif?t=1746870056\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629280/extras/96b30bb5f0e162908f933105b732e5cf.webm?t=1746870056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629280/extras/96b30bb5f0e162908f933105b732e5cf.mp4?t=1746870056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14 levels, each with its own set of enemies, environment, and distinctive feel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 unique cybernetics and pieces of equipment to fuel your creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep and rewarding Skill Tree.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629280/extras/37844992bdbd099c5ae549fce1c5b08f.poster.avif?t=1746870056\" width=800 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629280/extras/37844992bdbd099c5ae549fce1c5b08f.webm?t=1746870056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629280/extras/37844992bdbd099c5ae549fce1c5b08f.mp4?t=1746870056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629280/extras/9dc008b30b1ad6eb0a0ceab8f6fcf43c.webp?t=1746870056\" width=600 height=38 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 3rd-person action-roguelite space adventure that seamlessly blends text-based events with procedurally generated dungeons, offering hundreds of hours of replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629280/extras/26496099dc738488a78646c7968463b7.poster.avif?t=1746870056\" width=800 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629280/extras/26496099dc738488a78646c7968463b7.webm?t=1746870056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629280/extras/26496099dc738488a78646c7968463b7.mp4?t=1746870056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aggressive, brutal combat that leaves no room for mercy - permadeath is a constant threat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A plethora of guns, each leveled and uniquely seeded for countless combination possibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated levels ensure that no two playthroughs are alike, with over 4 billion seeded runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destructible environments allow you to carve your way through each space station, creating new flanking opportunities or launching enemies into space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629280/extras/96b30bb5f0e162908f933105b732e5cf.poster.avif?t=1746870056\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629280/extras/96b30bb5f0e162908f933105b732e5cf.webm?t=1746870056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629280/extras/96b30bb5f0e162908f933105b732e5cf.mp4?t=1746870056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14 levels, each with its own set of enemies, environment, and distinctive feel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 unique cybernetics and pieces of equipment to fuel your creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep and rewarding Skill Tree.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629280/extras/37844992bdbd099c5ae549fce1c5b08f.poster.avif?t=1746870056\" width=800 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629280/extras/37844992bdbd099c5ae549fce1c5b08f.webm?t=1746870056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629280/extras/37844992bdbd099c5ae549fce1c5b08f.mp4?t=1746870056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Dread Protocol is a 3rd-person roguelite blending FTL-style events and navigation with brutal, punishing combat. Explore procedurally generated space stations, carve your path through destructible walls, and dismantle the Federation one station at a time.",
